4. Take 2 numbers as inputs and find their HCF and LCM
flowchart:
        Start
          │
          ▼
    Read A and B
          │
          ▼
      tempA = A
      tempB = B
          │
          ▼
     Is tempB ≠ 0?
      ┌────┴────┐
     Yes        No
      │          │
      ▼          ▼
 remainder = tempA % tempB
 tempA = tempB
 tempB = remainder
      │
      └──────────► Repeat
          │
          ▼
     HCF = tempA
     LCM = (A × B) / HCF
          │
          ▼
 Print HCF and LCM
          │
          ▼
         Stop
pseudocode:
START

Input A, B

tempA = A
tempB = B

WHILE tempB != 0
    remainder = tempA % tempB
    tempA = tempB
    tempB = remainder
END WHILE

HCF = tempA
LCM = (A * B) / HCF

PRINT HCF
PRINT LCM

STOP

